{
  "name": "capture_frame_phase",
  "description": "抓帧相位与截图落盘端到端（GUI，pools.json isolated 逐例 legacy 启动）：测试床 project.godot 的 editor/run/main_run_args 默认 --headless，headless 游戏进程无渲染输出，无法取图，故 before_all 临时清空该设置并 save_project_settings，让从 GUI 编辑器启动的游戏以真实渲染运行，after_all 恢复 --headless（before_all 失败时 after_all 仍执行，见 pipeline_executor）。链路：create_editor_scene CapturePhaseProbe + PhaseLabel → 保存 res://gda_tmp_capture_phase/probe.tscn → open + play → ① execute_game_script 等待 0.3s 计时器后把 PhaseLabel.text 改为 PROBE（帧相位用例的等待窗）→ ② capture_game_viewport{when:PhaseLabel.text==\"PROBE\"} 断言返回体含 when_satisfied_frame 与 captured_frame（两字段均为帧号，captured_frame 在满足帧的下一帧读取；L2 断言语法只有 value/not_empty/not_contains，无法直接断言 captured_frame>when_satisfied_frame，故此处锁字段存在与 data 非空，帧号序由 T-33 报告人工复核）→ ③ capture_game_viewport{after_frames:3} 同样断言两帧号字段 → ④ 连续 10 次 capture_game_viewport{save:true, save_dir:res://gda_tmp_capture_phase/captures} 断言每次 saved_path 非空，再用 list_directory 断言目录 total=10（命名 gda_capture_<yyyyMMdd-HHmmss>_<序号> 不撞名）→ ⑤ capture_editor_viewport{target:\"game\", save:true, save_dir:res://gda_tmp_capture_phase/captures_editor} 断言 saved_path 非空（修复 target=game 静默忽略 save），list_directory 断言 total=1。requires 需 write（save 能力门 + set_project_settings/save_project_settings）与 game_runtime（play/execute_game_script）。",
  "headless": false,
  "requires": [
    "write",
    "code_execute",
    "game_runtime"
  ],
  "pipeline": {
    "on_failure": "fail_fast",
    "before_all": [
      {
        "id": "phase_clear_run_args",
        "tool": "set_project_settings",
        "args": {
          "name": "editor/run/main_run_args",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "phase_create_scene",
        "tool": "create_editor_scene",
        "args": {
          "name": "CapturePhaseProbe",
          "close_current": true
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "phase_create_label",
        "tool": "create_scene_node",
        "args": {
          "name": "PhaseLabel",
          "type": "Label",
          "parent_path": "CapturePhaseProbe",
          "properties": {
            "text": "IDLE",
            "offset_left": 20,
            "offset_top": 20,
            "offset_right": 220,
            "offset_bottom": 60
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "phase_save_scene",
        "tool": "save_editor_scene_as",
        "args": {
          "path": "res://gda_tmp_capture_phase/probe.tscn"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "phase_open_scene",
        "tool": "open_editor_scene",
        "args": {
          "path": "res://gda_tmp_capture_phase/probe.tscn"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "phase_play",
        "tool": "play_editor_current_scene",
        "args": {}
      }
    ],
    "stages": [
      {
        "id": "frame_phase",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "phase_arm_label",
            "tool": "execute_game_script",
            "args": {
              "action": "script",
              "source_code": "var label = get_node(\"/root/CapturePhaseProbe/PhaseLabel\")\nawait get_tree().create_timer(0.3).timeout\nlabel.text = \"PROBE\"\nreturn true",
              "timeout_ms": 8000
            },
            "expect": {
              "field_checks": [
                {
                  "key": "result",
                  "value": true
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "phase_capture_when",
            "tool": "capture_game_viewport",
            "args": {
              "when": "get_node(\"/root/CapturePhaseProbe/PhaseLabel\").text == \"PROBE\"",
              "timeout_ms": 8000
            },
            "expect": {
              "has_keys": [
                "data",
                "path",
                "when_satisfied_frame",
                "captured_frame"
              ],
              "field_checks": [
                {
                  "key": "data",
                  "not_empty": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "when_satisfied_frame",
                  "not_empty": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "captured_frame",
                  "not_empty": true
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "phase_capture_after_frames",
            "tool": "capture_game_viewport",
            "args": {
              "after_frames": 3,
              "timeout_ms": 8000
            },
            "expect": {
              "has_keys": [
                "data",
                "path",
                "when_satisfied_frame",
                "captured_frame"
              ],
              "field_checks": [
                {
                  "key": "data",
                  "not_empty": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "when_satisfied_frame",
                  "not_empty": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "captured_frame",
                  "not_empty": true
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "capture_save",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "capture_save_1",
            "tool": "capture_game_viewport",
            "args": {
              "save": true,
              "save_dir": "res://gda_tmp_capture_phase/captures",
              "timeout_ms": 8000
            },
            "expect": {
              "has_keys": [
                "data",
                "path",
                "saved_path"
              ],
              "field_checks": [
                {
